summary:
  A step back on the broadcast is taken also where no buffer can be parked in.

history:
  From the broadcast a step is a pause and a play. Where the pause
  would be a stop (a buffer too young, a cast, a silent player) the press
  would end the station, and the listener asked to hear more of it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          if (live && (ms > 0 || !tsPauseAvailable || !isPlaying())) return;

replace:
          if (live && ms > 0) return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_step_is_a_pause_and_a_play_through_the_one_door.
  Line-neutral.
